  "description": "Plan v7 section 8.3 runtime-limits clause: maximumGeneratedExpansionCharacters pinned exactly at 6. GeneratedExpansionBudget.consume is called once per generated placeholder expansion at depth > 0 with that expansion's own length, and interpolateTemplate memoizes by placeholder name, so the five keys separate three independently wrong billing models: 3+3 exactly spends the budget, 3+4 exceeds it, one 6-character placeholder referenced twice is billed once, and a two-link chain is billed at BOTH links (3+3 fits, 4+4 does not).",
